<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>陈宇翔 — AI驱动的产品探索者 · 项目管理实践者</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Manrope', 'Noto Sans SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', 'sans-serif'],
            display: ['Manrope', 'Noto Sans SC', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            primary: { 50: '#eff6ff', 100: '#dbeafe', 200: '#bfdbfe', 300: '#93c5fd', 400: '#60a5fa', 500: '#3b82f6', 600: '#2563eb', 700: '#1d4ed8', 800: '#1e40af', 900: '#1e3a8a' },
            accent: { light: '#0ea5e9', DEFAULT: '#0065fd', deep: '#0050cc' },
            surface: { DEFAULT: '#f8fafc', elevated: '#ffffff' }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --deep-blue: #0065fd;
      --sky-blue: #0ea5e9;
      --ice-purple: #8b5cf6;
      --bg-gradient-start: #f0f7ff;
      --bg-gradient-mid: #f8fbff;
      --bg-gradient-end: #ffffff;
    }

    * { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Manrope', 'Noto Sans SC', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.93) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.90) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.93) 100%),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?w=1920&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover no-repeat fixed,
        linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-gradient-start) 0%, var(--bg-gradient-mid) 30%, var(--bg-gradient-end) 100%);
      color: #0f172a;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Particle Canvas */
    #particle-canvas {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Glassmorphism */
    .glass {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    }
    .glass-strong {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.5);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.5);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }
    .glass-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.3);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(1.3);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.06), 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.04);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    .glass-card:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.12), 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.08);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    /* Glow effects */
    .glow-ring {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.15), 0 0 40px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.2), 0 0 80px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1);
    }
    .text-glow {
      text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.3);
    }
    .accent-glow {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.15);
    }

    /* Light sweep on hover */
    .light-sweep {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .light-sweep::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: -100%;
      width: 50%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent);
      transition: left 0.6s ease;
    }
    .light-sweep:hover::after {
      left: 150%;
    }

    /* Typewriter */
    .typewriter-cursor::after {
      content: '|';
      animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      font-weight: 300;
    }
    @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }

    /* Scroll animations */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: all 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }
    .reveal.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .reveal-delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
    .reveal-delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
    .reveal-delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
    .reveal-delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

    /* Timeline */
    .timeline-line {
      position: absolute;
      left: 24px;
      top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--deep-blue), var(--sky-blue), transparent);
    }
    .timeline-dot {
      width: 16px; height: 16px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-blue), var(--sky-blue));
      border: 3px solid white;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.2);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Skill bars */
    .skill-bar {
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .skill-bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--deep-blue), var(--sky-blue));
      width: 0;
      transition: width 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    }

    /* Nav */
    .nav-glass {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 20px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.06);
    }

    /* Floating animation */
    @keyframes float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }
    .float-anim { animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .float-anim-delay { animation: float 4s ease-in-out 1s infinite; }
    .float-anim-delay2 { animation: float 4s ease-in-out 2s infinite; }

    /* Shimmer */
    @keyframes shimmer {
      0% { background-position: -200% center; }
      100% { background-position: 200% center; }
    }
    .shimmer-text {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0f172a 0%, var(--deep-blue) 50%, #0f172a 100%);
      background-size: 200% auto;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      animation: shimmer 4s linear infinite;
    }

    /* Gradient text */
    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--deep-blue), var(--sky-blue), var(--ice-purple));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    /* Tag pills */
    .tag-pill {
      background: rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.15);
      color: var(--deep-blue);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .tag-pill:hover {
      background: rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.15);
      border-color: rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.3);
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    /* QR hover */
    .qr-container {
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
    }
    .qr-container:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.15);
    }

    /* Section titles */
    .section-title {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    .section-title::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -6px; left: 0;
      width: 48px; height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--deep-blue), var(--sky-blue));
    }

    /* Smooth scroll offset for fixed nav */
    section[id] { scroll-margin-top: 80px; }

    /* Background Decorations */
    .bg-blob {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .bg-grid {
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 32px 32px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .bg-dots {
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.04) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .bg-mesh {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(at 40% 20%, rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.08) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 80% 0%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 0% 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 80% 50%, rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.05) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 0% 100%, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.06) 0px, transparent 50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .orbit-ring {
      position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 101, 253, 0.08);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: orbit-rotate 60s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes orbit-rotate {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }
    @keyframes float-slow {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(3deg); }
    }
    .float-deco {
      animation: float-slow 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .float-deco-delay {
      animation: float-slow 10s ease-in-out 2s infinite;
    }
    .float-deco-delay2 {
      animation: float-slow 12s ease-in-out 4s infinite;
    }

    /* Mobile particles disabled via JS */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hide-mobile { display: none; }
      .bg-blob { display: none; }
      .orbit-ring { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen antialiased relative">
  <canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>
  <!-- Global mesh gradient overlay -->
  <div class="bg-mesh fixed inset-0"></div>
  <!-- Global dot pattern -->
  <div class="bg-dots fixed inset-0 opacity-50"></div>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav id="navbar" class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="#hero" class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 tracking-tight">陈宇翔</a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">
        <a href="#about" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">关于</a>
        <a href="#education" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">教育</a>
        <a href="#experience" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">经历</a>
        <a href="#project" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">项目</a>
        <a href="#skills" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">技能</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-accent-light text-white text-xs font-semibold hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-accent/25 transition-all">联系我</a>
      </div>
      <button id="mobile-menu-btn" class="md:hidden p-2 text-slate-600">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <!-- Mobile menu -->
    <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden glass-strong mx-4 rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">
        <a href="#about" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent/5">关于</a>
        <a href="#education" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent/5">教育</a>
      <a href="#experience" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent/5">经历</a>
      <a href="#project" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent/5">项目</a>
      <a href="#skills" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-accent/5">技能</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-accent-light text-white text-center">联系我</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section id="hero" class="relative z-10 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-20 pb-16 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative blobs -->
    <div class="bg-blob w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 to-accent-light/10 -top-20 -right-20 float-deco"></div>
    <div class="bg-blob w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-light/15 to-purple-400/10 bottom-20 -left-20 float-deco-delay"></div>
    <div class="bg-blob w-64 h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-300/10 to-accent/10 top-1/3 right-1/4 float-deco-delay2"></div>
    <!-- Orbit ring -->
    <div class="orbit-ring w-[600px] h-[600px] top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-30"></div>
    <div class="orbit-ring w-[800px] h-[800px] top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-20" style="animation-duration: 80s; animation-direction: reverse;"></div>
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Avatar & Info -->
        <div class="text-center lg:text-left order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full glass text-xs font-medium text-accent mb-6">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
            求职中 — 项目管理 / AI应用 / AI产品经理
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-display font-black text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight mb-4">
            <span class="text-slate-900">陈宇翔</span>
          </h1>
          <p id="typewriter" class="typewriter-cursor text-xl md:text-2xl font-light text-slate-500 mb-8 h-8"></p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto lg:mx-0 mb-8">
            5年工程项目管理经验 · 2段腾讯游戏研发项目实习 · 从施工现场到互联网产研，<br class="hidden md:block">用技术理解力驱动产品落地，用项目管理方法论保障交付质量。
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center lg:justify-start mb-8">
            <a href="#project" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-accent-light text-white font-semibold text-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/30 transition-all light-sweep">查看项目</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl glass text-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-white/80 transition-all">联系我</a>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 justify-center lg:justify-start text-xs text-slate-400">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>四川成都</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>736053336@qq.com</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Right: Avatar + Stats -->
        <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="relative mb-10">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/20 to-accent-light/20 blur-2xl scale-110"></div>
            <img src="./knowledge_base/assets/个人正装照.jpg" alt="陈宇翔" class="relative w-48 h-48 md:w-64 md:h-64 rounded-full object-cover glow-ring border-4 border-white/80 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="absolute -bottom-2 -right-2 w-14 h-14 rounded-full glass-strong flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
              <span class="text-xl">🚀</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Stat Cards -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 w-full max-w-sm">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 text-center float-anim">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black gradient-text">5年</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">工程管理经验</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 text-center float-anim-delay">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black gradient-text">2段</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">腾讯实习经历</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 text-center float-anim-delay2">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black gradient-text">1款</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">上线产品</div>
            </div>
            <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-4 text-center float-anim">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black gradient-text">3.92</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">硕士GPA / 5.0</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 animate-bounce">
      <span class="text-xs">向下滚动</span>
      <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"/></svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section id="about" class="relative z-10 py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-blob w-80 h-80 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/10 to-purple-400/5 top-10 right-0 float-deco"></div>
    <div class="bg-blob w-60 h-60 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-light/10 to-cyan-300/5 bottom-10 left-0 float-deco-delay"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase mb-3 block">About Me</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-10">关于我</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8">
        <div class="md:col-span-3 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8">
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
              5年工程实战经验 + 2段腾讯产研实习，从施工现场走到互联网研发。懂<strong class="text-slate-800">TAPD敏捷流程</strong>，也会写<strong class="text-slate-800">Python做数据分析</strong>；能牵头SOP制定，也能亲手把想法做成上线产品。
            </p>
            <section id="education" class="relative z-10 py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-blob w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-light/10 to-purple-400/5 top-0 left-0 float-deco-delay"></div>
    <div class="bg-blob w-64 h-64 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-300/8 to-accent/5 bottom-0 right-0 float-deco-delay2"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase mb-3 block">Education</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mx-auto mb-4">教育背景</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500">工学与管理学双学士学位 + 项目管理硕士学位，跨学科知识体系。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <section id="experience" class="relative z-10 py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-blob w-80 h-80 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent/8 to-accent-light/5 top-1/4 -right-20 float-deco"></div>
    <div class="orbit-ring w-[500px] h-[500px] top-1/2 left-1/4 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal text-center mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase mb-3 block">Experience</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mx-auto mb-4">工作与实习经历</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500">从工程现场到互联网产研，跨领域积累项目管理实战经验。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="timeline-line"></div>

        <section id="project" class="relative z-10 py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-blob w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-400/10 to-accent/5 -top-10 -left-20 float-deco"></div>
    <div class="bg-blob w-72 h-72 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-light/10 to-cyan-300/5 bottom-20 -right-10 float-deco-delay"></div>
